## What this is

The {AGENT_NAME} engine, packaged for buyer distribution.

- Same engine code that runs production at Glitch Executor Labs.
- All client-specific configuration, secrets, logs, recordings, and
  decision history have been stripped. You configure for your own
  brands from a clean slate.
- BSL 1.1 source-available licence — you may modify, deploy, white-
  label, and resell the service to clients. Full terms in `LICENSE.md`.

## What this is not

- **It is not a hosted service.** You deploy it. We do not run it
  for you. Your client data stays on your infrastructure forever.
- **It is not a SaaS subscription.** One-time purchase, perpetual licence.
- **It is not a no-code workflow.** It is real source code that runs
  as a real service. The non-code path is letting Claude Code drive
  the install via `AGENTS.md`.

## Repo layout

```
{repo-root}
├── AGENTS.md            ← Claude-actionable install + operate spec (read this)
