## Quick start

The fastest path is to let Claude Code do the install:

```
git clone git@codeberg.org:glitch-executor/{REPO_NAME}.git
cd {REPO_NAME}
# Open the folder in Claude Code, paste:
#   "Read AGENTS.md and set this agent up for me."
```

The full manual install path lives in `AGENTS.md` — same content,
written in the structure Claude Code reads, but a human can read
top-to-bottom too.

## Updates

When we ship engine improvements, you pull them:

```
git pull
```

Or in Claude Code: *"Update the agent to the latest version."*
Claude reads the update section in `AGENTS.md`, runs the steps,
re-runs the smoke test, tells you when you're back online.

